{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/8952359448fc9e6fd2674c01a06531fb17ce0364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are two points on the line whose equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d45f416c90a5d41149b1195b11117c307840778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, then the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/8952359448fc9e6fd2674c01a06531fb17ce0364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/685161fe6bfaf2b83e254863dd4058e2d72c4835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c1ab12c5465789b4823d52f0564d469b0f9803d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } |a-c|\\sqrt{1+m^2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }|a+c|\\sqrt{1+m^2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{|a-c|}{\\sqrt{1+m^2}} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"476\" height=\"43\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2cf78be58419a8115c0f9fe48285b6577098c0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D) \\  } |a-c|(1+m^2) \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }|a-c|\\,|m|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"294\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d45f416c90a5d41149b1195b11117c307840778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda75bed8f09da3788e6f61f0fd5d11208a218b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=am+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a08f7e22f7a38b2dc3a2eea118461f20485167a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=cm+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />. Using the distance formula, the distance between the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/8952359448fc9e6fd2674c01a06531fb17ce0364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de8123268c74788b50d90bc095a4e71ef7184959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(a-c)^2+(b-d)^2}=\\sqrt{(a-c)^2+(am+k-cm-k)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"446\" height=\"32\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0acf3daac793eff07e3fb0f87d2f1fc121b4616b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{(a-c)^2+m^2(a-c)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"205\" height=\"32\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986af6ea00e982680f75d1b3ad453a5cdb98f759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=|a-c|\\sqrt{1+m^2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>And so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171513\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 163/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3615/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.500      1 -total\n 57.64%    7.205      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.02%    5.002      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11144:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171513 and revision id 197257. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}